[h2]Update[/h2]

[b]New[/b]
[list]
[*]Secrets of the Higher Mysteries: clicking a province in the Mystery Casting map mode opens the Mysteries window aimed at it, then closes the holding view.
[*]AGOT's settlement buttons now show in the holding view.
[/list]

[b]Changes[/b]
[list]
[*]Updated for AGOT 0.5.2.1 (CK3 1.19.0.6).
[*]Character portraits and icons in the header resized to match AGOT.
[*]Removed old unused trading post code.
[/list]

[b]Fixes[/b]
[list]
[*]Buttons on provinces with no holding built now act for the county's holder instead of failing.
[/list]
